{"id":"en_the-ex-wife-s-regret-losing-the-space-hero","title":"The Ex-Wife's Regret: Losing the Space Hero","titleEn":"The Ex-Wife's Regret: Losing the Space Hero","description":"To repay a debt of kindness, Neil enters a secret agreement with Keira's father: he will marry Keira for five years and help her heal from the painful breakup with her first love, Simon. Throughout the contract marriage, Neil remains attentive and caring, yet Keira treats him only as a stand-in for Simon. When the five years end, Neil sees that her infatuation with Simon persists and resolves to divorce her. Upon receiving the divorce agreement and learning from her father that Neil has gone, Keira is overwhelmed with regret. She travels the world in search of him and finally understands that the man she lost genuinely loved her. Her realization comes too late, however, as Neil has already set off on a new and promising path, leaving her behind for good.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ex-wifes-regret-losing-the-space-hero/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ex-wifes-regret-losing-the-space-hero/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Male","Regret","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtt2o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-ex-wife-s-regret-losing-the-space-hero_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtt2o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ex-wife-s-regret-losing-the-space-hero_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtt2o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ex-wife-s-regret-losing-the-space-hero_3","title":"Episode 3","s